    "What is your relationship with mathematics?": "I see math as a language of patterns, not just numbers but structures that shape how we understand the world. It connects deeply with my love for literature and computer science, offering clarity and creativity. Though I don't love it obsessively, I respect its elegance and often find comfort in its logic, especially when life feels chaotic.",
