    "Did you ever use AI to support your math learning in the last year? If yes, how was your experience?": "Yes, I’ve used AI tools like chatbots and equation solvers to check my work or explore new concepts. It was helpful for quick insights, but I noticed I sometimes relied too much on answers instead of thinking deeply. Still, it made learning more accessible, especially when tutors weren’t available.",
